--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,820] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 11 | Text: 自主的事情凡是能做大事的人
Segment #2   [00:00:01,820 --> 00:00:03,360] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 9  | Text: 他都不是去补自己的短板
Segment #3   [00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:04,640] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 8  | Text: 而是找到自己的优势
Segment #4   [00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:05,440] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 6  | Text: 找到自己的特长
Segment #5   [00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:07,300] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 10 | Text: 把自己的优势发挥到极致
Segment #6   [00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:08,060] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 3  | Text: 你比如说
Segment #7   [00:00:08,060 --> 00:00:09,020] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 4  | Text: 你喜欢演讲
Segment #8   [00:00:09,020 --> 00:00:09,860] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 5  | Text: 那你去演讲
Segment #9   [00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:10,660] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 4  | Text: 你喜欢跳舞
Segment #10  [00:00:10,660 --> 00:00:11,260] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 4  | Text: 你去跳舞
Segment #11  [00:00:11,260 --> 00:00:12,760] | Elapsed:  16.95s | Words: 11 | Text: 你就把一件事去发挥到极致
Segment #12  [00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:13,020] | Elapsed:  16.95s | Words: 1  | Text: 你可以
Segment #13  [00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:14,080] | Elapsed:  16.95s | Words: 5  | Text: 你的特长是什么
Segment #14  [00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:14,860] | Elapsed:  16.95s | Words: 3  | Text: 你就做什么
Segment #15  [00:00:14,860 --> 00:00:16,580] | Elapsed:  16.95s | Words: 9  | Text: 我从来没有见过任何一个
Segment #16  [00:00:16,580 --> 00:00:17,920] | Elapsed:  16.95s | Words: 6  | Text: 能把事做成的人
Segment #17  [00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:18,740] | Elapsed:  16.95s | Words: 4  | Text: 他是找到了一个
Segment #18  [00:00:18,740 --> 00:00:19,680] | Elapsed:  16.95s | Words: 7  | Text: 不属于自己的特长
Segment #19  [00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:20,180] | Elapsed:  16.95s | Words: 3  | Text: 找到了一个
Segment #20  [00:00:20,180 --> 00:00:21,020] | Elapsed:  16.95s | Words: 5  | Text: 不是自己的爱的
Segment #21  [00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:21,500] | Elapsed:  16.95s | Words: 3  | Text: 找到了一个
Segment #22  [00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:22,580] | Elapsed:  16.95s | Words: 7  | Text: 不是自己人生危机的
Segment #23  [00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:23,520] | Elapsed:  16.95s | Words: 7  | Text: 行业能把事做成
Segment #24  [00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:24,760] | Elapsed:  16.95s | Words: 6  | Text: 王伯大家都看过我
Segment #25  [00:00:24,760 --> 00:00:26,500] | Elapsed:  16.95s | Words: 10 | Text: 王伯的故事其实就挺厉害
Segment #26  [00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:26,900] | Elapsed:  16.95s | Words: 2  | Text: feel
Segment #27  [00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:27,880] | Elapsed:  37.28s | Words: 5  | Text: 唱歌当歌型
Segment #28  [00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:29,580] | Elapsed:  37.28s | Words: 7  | Text: 王伯的唱歌非常好
Segment #29  [00:00:29,580 --> 00:00:31,300] | Elapsed:  37.28s | Words: 10 | Text: 你们有听过王伯唱歌的吗
Segment #30  [00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:33,200] | Elapsed:  37.28s | Words: 9  | Text: 他的歌声是非常有词性的
Segment #31  [00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:34,580] | Elapsed:  37.28s | Words: 4  | Text: 而且穿透笔
Segment #32  [00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:36,720] | Elapsed:  37.28s | Words: 7  | Text: 好的歌曲在唱歌的时候
Segment #33  [00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:37,600] | Elapsed:  37.28s | Words: 4  | Text: 表达的是什么
Segment #34  [00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:38,740] | Elapsed:  37.28s | Words: 6  | Text: 是情感的传递
Segment #35  [00:00:38,740 --> 00:00:40,740] | Elapsed:  37.28s | Words: 6  | Text: 而且他没有很多自己的
Segment #36  [00:00:40,740 --> 00:00:41,320] | Elapsed:  37.28s | Words: 4  | Text: 原创歌曲
Segment #37  [00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:42,700] | Elapsed:  37.29s | Words: 10 | Text: 因为他并不是一个职业的歌手
Segment #38  [00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:44,940] | Elapsed:  37.29s | Words: 9  | Text: 你会通过这个人去选择
Segment #39  [00:00:44,940 --> 00:00:45,760] | Elapsed:  37.29s | Words: 5  | Text: 唱什么样的歌
Segment #40  [00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:47,400] | Elapsed:  37.29s | Words: 10 | Text: 来评判出这个人的价值观
Segment #41  [00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:49,080] | Elapsed:  37.29s | Words: 10 | Text: 你比如说我今天唱出结论的
Segment #42  [00:00:49,080 --> 00:00:49,720] | Elapsed:  37.29s | Words: 4  | Text: 英文爱情
Segment #43  [00:00:49,720 --> 00:00:50,560] | Elapsed:  37.29s | Words: 4  | Text: 那说明我是
Segment #44  [00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:51,440] | Elapsed:  37.29s | Words: 4  | Text: 可能我失恋
Segment #45  [00:00:51,440 --> 00:00:52,140] | Elapsed:  37.29s | Words: 5  | Text: 我是一个恋爱脑
Segment #46  [00:00:52,140 --> 00:00:53,340] | Elapsed:  37.29s | Words: 5  | Text: 比如说我今天唱
Segment #47  [00:00:53,340 --> 00:00:54,120] | Elapsed:  37.29s | Words: 3  | Text: 相应自己
Segment #48  [00:00:54,120 --> 00:00:55,300] | Elapsed:  37.29s | Words: 8  | Text: 那说明我对于人生
Segment #49  [00:00:55,300 --> 00:00:56,500] | Elapsed:  37.29s | Words: 8  | Text: 是比较保佑乐观的
Segment #50  [00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:58,300] | Elapsed:  57.60s | Words: 10 | Text: 那比如说我今天唱重复在来
Segment #51  [00:00:58,300 --> 00:01:00,040] | Elapsed:  57.60s | Words: 9  | Text: 那说明我的前半段人生
Segment #52  [00:01:00,040 --> 00:01:01,460] | Elapsed:  57.60s | Words: 11 | Text: 肯定是经历的不堪和难过
Segment #53  [00:01:01,460 --> 00:01:03,500] | Elapsed:  57.60s | Words: 10 | Text: 比如说通过这个人喜欢的歌曲
Segment #54  [00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:04,760] | Elapsed:  57.60s | Words: 10 | Text: 而评判出这个人的价值观
Segment #55  [00:01:04,760 --> 00:01:05,460] | Elapsed:  57.60s | Words: 3  | Text: 我告诉你
Segment #56  [00:01:05,460 --> 00:01:07,220] | Elapsed:  57.60s | Words: 10 | Text: 王伯唱的歌是很有感情的
Segment #57  [00:01:07,220 --> 00:01:08,360] | Elapsed:  57.60s | Words: 3  | Text: 而且几次
Segment #58  [00:01:08,360 --> 00:01:09,940] | Elapsed:  57.60s | Words: 9  | Text: 就是你们可以用心去听一听
Segment #59  [00:01:09,940 --> 00:01:11,140] | Elapsed:  57.60s | Words: 4  | Text: 可以在几次
Segment #60  [00:01:11,140 --> 00:01:12,840] | Elapsed:  57.60s | Words: 6  | Text: 晚上一个人悄悄的
Segment #61  [00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:13,800] | Elapsed:  57.60s | Words: 6  | Text: 在被我听歌的时候
Segment #62  [00:01:13,800 --> 00:01:14,700] | Elapsed:  57.60s | Words: 4  | Text: 我会听哭
Segment #63  [00:01:14,700 --> 00:01:16,760] | Elapsed:  57.60s | Words: 8  | Text: 就是当你晚上去不着觉
Segment #64  [00:01:16,760 --> 00:01:17,200] | Elapsed:  57.60s | Words: 3  | Text: 闭着眼
Segment #65  [00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:18,100] | Elapsed:  57.60s | Words: 5  | Text: 躺在床上的时候
Segment #66  [00:01:18,100 --> 00:01:20,140] | Elapsed:  57.60s | Words: 9  | Text: 当眼泪滑过鼻梁流进
Segment #67  [00:01:20,140 --> 00:01:21,140] | Elapsed:  57.60s | Words: 6  | Text: 另外一支眼里的时候
Segment #68  [00:01:21,140 --> 00:01:21,840] | Elapsed:  57.60s | Words: 5  | Text: 会碰上感觉
Segment #69  [00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:22,460] | Elapsed:  57.60s | Words: 4  | Text: 在那一刻
Segment #70  [00:01:22,460 --> 00:01:22,900] | Elapsed:  57.60s | Words: 2  | Text: 你懂
Segment #71  [00:01:22,900 --> 00:01:24,140] | Elapsed:  57.60s | Words: 3  | Text: 你懂他的
Segment #72  [00:01:24,140 --> 00:01:24,780] | Elapsed:  57.60s | Words: 3  | Text: 你懂我
Segment #73  [00:01:24,780 --> 00:01:25,960] | Elapsed:  57.60s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是他前很多年
Segment #74  [00:01:25,960 --> 00:01:26,860] | Elapsed:  77.79s | Words: 7  | Text: 在北京是陆陆维
Segment #75  [00:01:26,860 --> 00:01:28,300] | Elapsed:  77.79s | Words: 7  | Text: 是没有任何的希望的
Segment #76  [00:01:28,300 --> 00:01:28,620] | Elapsed:  77.79s | Words: 2  | Text: 看不到
Segment #77  [00:01:28,620 --> 00:01:30,200] | Elapsed:  77.79s | Words: 11 | Text: 在酒吧唱了一天唱200块钱
Segment #78  [00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:31,860] | Elapsed:  77.80s | Words: 11 | Text: 还被观众拿酒瓶的蒸酱水
Segment #79  [00:01:31,860 --> 00:01:32,720] | Elapsed:  77.80s | Words: 8  | Text: 你妈妈就找他带出来
Segment #80  [00:01:32,720 --> 00:01:33,460] | Elapsed:  77.80s | Words: 4  | Text: 你给我下来
Segment #81  [00:01:33,460 --> 00:01:35,600] | Elapsed:  77.80s | Words: 11 | Text: 你会在他的歌曲中获得力量
Segment #82  [00:01:35,600 --> 00:01:36,820] | Elapsed:  77.80s | Words: 6  | Text: 但他为什么他不火
Segment #83  [00:01:36,820 --> 00:01:37,840] | Elapsed:  77.80s | Words: 8  | Text: 唱了这么多年也不火
Segment #84  [00:01:37,840 --> 00:01:38,620] | Elapsed:  77.80s | Words: 5  | Text: 然后又去跳舞
Segment #85  [00:01:38,620 --> 00:01:40,060] | Elapsed:  77.80s | Words: 9  | Text: 跳舞跳了什么年也不火
Segment #86  [00:01:40,060 --> 00:01:41,660] | Elapsed:  77.80s | Words: 12 | Text: 在《无意间安》当了个演员
Segment #87  [00:01:41,660 --> 00:01:42,480] | Elapsed:  77.80s | Words: 6  | Text: 拍了一部电影
Segment #88  [00:01:42,480 --> 00:01:44,620] | Elapsed:  77.80s | Words: 13 | Text: 这部电影叫做《疯狂的石头》
Segment #89  [00:01:44,620 --> 00:01:45,280] | Elapsed:  77.80s | Words: 5  | Text: 我不知道你们有看过
Segment #90  [00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:46,500] | Elapsed:  77.80s | Words: 5  | Text: 等一下就火了
Segment #91  [00:01:46,500 --> 00:01:47,640] | Elapsed:  77.80s | Words: 7  | Text: 他就找到了自己的人生
Segment #92  [00:01:47,640 --> 00:01:48,720] | Elapsed:  77.80s | Words: 4  | Text: 而且他火的时候
Segment #93  [00:01:48,720 --> 00:01:49,460] | Elapsed:  77.80s | Words: 6  | Text: 他年纪也挺大的
Segment #94  [00:01:49,460 --> 00:01:50,520] | Elapsed:  77.80s | Words: 4  | Text: 你们就是35岁
Segment #95  [00:01:50,520 --> 00:01:51,020] | Elapsed:  77.80s | Words: 3  | Text: 45岁里
Segment #96  [00:01:51,020 --> 00:01:52,040] | Elapsed:  98.30s | Words: 6  | Text: 不要放弃自己的人生
Segment #97  [00:01:52,040 --> 00:01:53,040] | Elapsed:  98.30s | Words: 4  | Text: 我如果告诉你
Segment #98  [00:01:53,040 --> 00:01:55,000] | Elapsed:  98.30s | Words: 9  | Text: 江子雅80才出面打仗
Segment #99  [00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:56,940] | Elapsed:  98.30s | Words: 8  | Text: 刘备55岁才当王帝
Segment #100 [00:01:56,940 --> 00:01:57,620] | Elapsed:  98.30s | Words: 4  | Text: 那是鸡汤
Segment #101 [00:01:57,620 --> 00:01:58,200] | Elapsed:  98.30s | Words: 4  | Text: 那也没有用
Segment #102 [00:01:58,200 --> 00:01:59,640] | Elapsed:  98.30s | Words: 9  | Text: 他为什么刘备能当上王帝
Segment #103 [00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:00,800] | Elapsed:  98.30s | Words: 6  | Text: 你看论带兵打仗
Segment #104 [00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:03,320] | Elapsed:  98.30s | Words: 9  | Text: 他不如赵云 关羽 赵飞
Segment #105 [00:02:03,320 --> 00:02:04,240] | Elapsed:  98.30s | Words: 3  | Text: 论智慧
Segment #106 [00:02:04,240 --> 00:02:05,060] | Elapsed:  98.30s | Words: 6  | Text: 他不如诸葛兰
Segment #107 [00:02:05,060 --> 00:02:06,560] | Elapsed:  98.30s | Words: 6  | Text: 但为什么是他的作法
Segment #108 [00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:07,900] | Elapsed:  98.30s | Words: 5  | Text: 因为他有目标
Segment #109 [00:02:07,900 --> 00:02:09,620] | Elapsed:  98.30s | Words: 7  | Text: 他的目标就是他的梦想
Segment #110 [00:02:09,620 --> 00:02:11,180] | Elapsed:  98.30s | Words: 8  | Text: 他的梦想就是一冷天下
Segment #111 [00:02:11,180 --> 00:02:12,780] | Elapsed:  98.30s | Words: 8  | Text: 虽然我论带兵打仗
Segment #112 [00:02:12,780 --> 00:02:13,740] | Elapsed:  98.30s | Words: 4  | Text: 我不如赵云
Segment #113 [00:02:13,740 --> 00:02:16,280] | Elapsed:  98.30s | Words: 11 | Text: 论智慧我不如诸葛兰和庞德
Segment #114 [00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:17,440] | Elapsed:  98.30s | Words: 6  | Text: 但是他们的梦想没有
Segment #115 [00:02:17,440 --> 00:02:18,560] | Elapsed:  98.30s | Words: 3  | Text: 我是关羽
Segment #116 [00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:19,760] | Elapsed: 118.59s | Words: 9  | Text: 我的梦想是当大天王女
Segment #117 [00:02:19,760 --> 00:02:20,960] | Elapsed: 118.59s | Words: 9  | Text: 我带点小兵出去打打仗
Segment #118 [00:02:20,960 --> 00:02:21,680] | Elapsed: 118.59s | Words: 5  | Text: 我就挺厉害了
Segment #119 [00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:22,240] | Elapsed: 118.59s | Words: 6  | Text: 这些是我的目标
Segment #120 [00:02:22,240 --> 00:02:22,840] | Elapsed: 118.59s | Words: 4  | Text: 我就知足了
Segment #121 [00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:23,500] | Elapsed: 118.59s | Words: 4  | Text: 我就知足了
Segment #122 [00:02:23,500 --> 00:02:24,400] | Elapsed: 118.59s | Words: 8  | Text: 人这一辈子干什么事
Segment #123 [00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:25,400] | Elapsed: 118.59s | Words: 7  | Text: 这都是命中注定的
Segment #124 [00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:25,940] | Elapsed: 118.59s | Words: 5  | Text: 那做个案子
Segment #125 [00:02:25,940 --> 00:02:26,800] | Elapsed: 118.59s | Words: 7  | Text: 我能去当个宰相
Segment #126 [00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:27,860] | Elapsed: 118.59s | Words: 7  | Text: 我能扶索我的祖宫
Segment #127 [00:02:27,860 --> 00:02:28,800] | Elapsed: 118.59s | Words: 6  | Text: 我擅长我的普善
Segment #128 [00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:29,940] | Elapsed: 118.59s | Words: 6  | Text: 我就感觉我挺好了
Segment #129 [00:02:29,940 --> 00:02:31,780] | Elapsed: 118.59s | Words: 8  | Text: 就是人与人之间就是这样
Segment #130 [00:02:31,780 --> 00:02:33,420] | Elapsed: 118.59s | Words: 9  | Text: 不是有钱的影响没钱的
Segment #131 [00:02:33,420 --> 00:02:35,020] | Elapsed: 118.59s | Words: 11 | Text: 不是有能力的影响没能力的
Segment #132 [00:02:35,020 --> 00:02:36,540] | Elapsed: 118.59s | Words: 11 | Text: 不是有智慧的影响没智慧的
Segment #133 [00:02:36,540 --> 00:02:38,360] | Elapsed: 118.59s | Words: 11 | Text: 而是有梦想的影响没梦想
Segment #134 [00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:38,740] | Elapsed: 118.59s | Words: 2  | Text: 对不对
Segment #135 [00:02:38,740 --> 00:02:39,180] | Elapsed: 118.59s | Words: 3  | Text: 马云就是
Segment #136 [00:02:39,180 --> 00:02:40,860] | Elapsed: 118.59s | Words: 6  | Text: 马云论写编程
Segment #137 [00:02:41,700 --> 00:02:42,400] | Elapsed: 138.96s | Words: 3  | Text: 论融资
Segment #138 [00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:43,060] | Elapsed: 138.96s | Words: 5  | Text: 它底部过数
Segment #139 [00:02:43,060 --> 00:02:43,360] | Elapsed: 138.96s | Words: 2  | Text: 对不对
Segment #140 [00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:43,840] | Elapsed: 138.96s | Words: 4  | Text: 这个菜中心
Segment #141 [00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:45,860] | Elapsed: 138.96s | Words: 9  | Text: 论什么它都稍微差一点点
Segment #142 [00:02:45,860 --> 00:02:47,940] | Elapsed: 138.97s | Words: 8  | Text: 就是我们每一个人都是专采
Segment #143 [00:02:47,940 --> 00:02:48,640] | Elapsed: 138.97s | Words: 3  | Text: 不是权采
Segment #144 [00:02:48,640 --> 00:02:50,560] | Elapsed: 138.97s | Words: 11 | Text: 我们每一个人只能在自己特定的
Segment #145 [00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:52,720] | Elapsed: 138.97s | Words: 12 | Text: 专业里把自己的事发挥到戒指
Segment #146 [00:02:52,720 --> 00:02:53,680] | Elapsed: 138.97s | Words: 8  | Text: 它把什么发挥到戒指
Segment #147 [00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:55,000] | Elapsed: 138.97s | Words: 9  | Text: 把梦想发挥到的戒指
Segment #148 [00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:57,120] | Elapsed: 138.97s | Words: 13 | Text: 这个世界就是有梦想的影响没梦想的
Segment #149 [00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:58,380] | Elapsed: 138.97s | Words: 8  | Text: 与其说你现在不知道做啥
Segment #150 [00:02:58,380 --> 00:02:58,960] | Elapsed: 138.97s | Words: 3  | Text: 很迷茫
Segment #151 [00:02:58,960 --> 00:03:00,120] | Elapsed: 138.97s | Words: 6  | Text: 都是我现在45岁了
Segment #152 [00:03:00,120 --> 00:03:00,680] | Elapsed: 138.97s | Words: 4  | Text: 那杜老师
Segment #153 [00:03:00,680 --> 00:03:01,540] | Elapsed: 138.97s | Words: 5  | Text: 我现在38岁了
Segment #154 [00:03:01,540 --> 00:03:02,000] | Elapsed: 138.97s | Words: 3  | Text: 我很失态
Segment #155 [00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:03,280] | Elapsed: 138.97s | Words: 5  | Text: 你是没有梦想的
Segment #156 [00:03:03,280 --> 00:03:04,420] | Elapsed: 138.97s | Words: 6  | Text: 或许曾经有过
Segment #157 [00:03:04,420 --> 00:03:06,640] | Elapsed: 138.97s | Words: 11 | Text: 就在我们还保留赤子之心的时候
Segment #158 [00:03:06,640 --> 00:03:07,440] | Elapsed: 138.97s | Words: 5  | Text: 我们刚到社会
Segment #159 [00:03:07,440 --> 00:03:09,020] | Elapsed: 157.72s | Words: 6  | Text: 我们刚刚拍下工作
Segment #160 [00:03:09,020 --> 00:03:10,520] | Elapsed: 157.72s | Words: 5  | Text: 我们买枪热血
Segment #161 [00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:12,700] | Elapsed: 157.72s | Words: 11 | Text: 我们会为了自己的梦想去试措
Segment #162 [00:03:12,700 --> 00:03:13,660] | Elapsed: 157.72s | Words: 4  | Text: 会去试措
Segment #163 [00:03:13,660 --> 00:03:14,140] | Elapsed: 157.72s | Words: 2  | Text: 创业
Segment #164 [00:03:14,140 --> 00:03:16,220] | Elapsed: 157.72s | Words: 9  | Text: 会去让你一次文物改了
Segment #165 [00:03:16,220 --> 00:03:17,160] | Elapsed: 157.72s | Words: 3  | Text: 但是告诉你
Segment #166 [00:03:17,160 --> 00:03:18,480] | Elapsed: 157.72s | Words: 9  | Text: 你们壮男强是为了回头
Segment #167 [00:03:19,100 --> 00:03:20,560] | Elapsed: 157.72s | Words: 7  | Text: 真正去做大事的人
Segment #168 [00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:22,280] | Elapsed: 157.72s | Words: 10 | Text: 创男强是为了把小创夺
Segment #169 [00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:23,400] | Elapsed: 157.72s | Words: 4  | Text: 在这个路上
Segment #170 [00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:25,020] | Elapsed: 157.72s | Words: 9  | Text: 真正的能把事做成的人
Segment #171 [00:03:25,020 --> 00:03:26,760] | Elapsed: 157.72s | Words: 9  | Text: 他会要忍受很多的东西
Segment #172 [00:03:26,760 --> 00:03:27,700] | Elapsed: 157.72s | Words: 6  | Text: 承受很多的东西
Segment #173 [00:03:27,700 --> 00:03:28,980] | Elapsed: 157.72s | Words: 6  | Text: 为什么说二八定律
Segment #174 [00:03:28,980 --> 00:03:30,320] | Elapsed: 157.72s | Words: 7  | Text: 不是20%的有钱人
Segment #175 [00:03:30,320 --> 00:03:31,600] | Elapsed: 157.72s | Words: 6  | Text: 80%的普通人
Segment #176 [00:03:31,600 --> 00:03:33,500] | Elapsed: 157.72s | Words: 8  | Text: 是0.02%的有钱人
Segment #177 [00:03:33,500 --> 00:03:35,460] | Elapsed: 157.72s | Words: 8  | Text: 和99.8%的普通人
Segment #178 [00:03:35,460 --> 00:03:36,100] | Elapsed: 157.72s | Words: 3  | Text: 但是告诉你
Segment #179 [00:03:36,100 --> 00:03:36,840] | Elapsed: 157.72s | Words: 4  | Text: 别说0.02
Segment #180 [00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:38,360] | Elapsed: 176.11s | Words: 6  | Text: 哪怕是0.0002
Segment #181 [00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:39,640] | Elapsed: 176.11s | Words: 6  | Text: 这个人为什么不能生意
Segment #182 [00:03:39,640 --> 00:03:40,480] | Elapsed: 176.11s | Words: 6  | Text: 你做任何的事情
Segment #183 [00:03:40,480 --> 00:03:41,680] | Elapsed: 176.11s | Words: 7  | Text: 你拿一年 拿两年
Segment #184 [00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:42,720] | Elapsed: 176.11s | Words: 7  | Text: 去衡量结果导限
Segment #185 [00:03:42,720 --> 00:03:43,520] | Elapsed: 176.11s | Words: 5  | Text: 你两年你要么
Segment #186 [00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:44,280] | Elapsed: 176.11s | Words: 4  | Text: 你要赚多少钱
Segment #187 [00:03:44,280 --> 00:03:45,060] | Elapsed: 176.11s | Words: 3  | Text: 赚不到的
Segment #188 [00:03:45,060 --> 00:03:46,160] | Elapsed: 176.11s | Words: 7  | Text: 诸位量七出七三
Segment #189 [00:03:46,160 --> 00:03:46,660] | Elapsed: 176.11s | Words: 2  | Text: 被罚
Segment #190 [00:03:46,660 --> 00:03:47,920] | Elapsed: 176.11s | Words: 4  | Text: 生活十年的时间
Segment #191 [00:03:47,920 --> 00:03:49,440] | Elapsed: 176.11s | Words: 8  | Text: 都还没一统变一样
Segment #192 [00:03:49,440 --> 00:03:50,300] | Elapsed: 176.11s | Words: 5  | Text: 做任何一件事情
Segment #193 [00:03:50,300 --> 00:03:51,640] | Elapsed: 176.11s | Words: 7  | Text: 你站在十年的角度
Segment #194 [00:03:51,640 --> 00:03:52,220] | Elapsed: 176.11s | Words: 2  | Text: 去想
Segment #195 [00:03:52,220 --> 00:03:53,420] | Elapsed: 176.11s | Words: 7  | Text: 哪怕你今年六十岁
Segment #196 [00:03:53,420 --> 00:03:54,480] | Elapsed: 176.11s | Words: 9  | Text: 再过十年你七十岁了
Segment #197 [00:03:54,480 --> 00:03:55,160] | Elapsed: 176.11s | Words: 4  | Text: 你一样可以
Segment #198 [00:03:55,160 --> 00:03:56,360] | Elapsed: 176.11s | Words: 6  | Text: 看似三年五年
Segment #199 [00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:56,880] | Elapsed: 176.11s | Words: 3  | Text: 时间很长
Segment #200 [00:03:56,880 --> 00:03:57,700] | Elapsed: 176.11s | Words: 4  | Text: 但是我告诉你
Segment #201 [00:03:57,700 --> 00:03:58,480] | Elapsed: 176.11s | Words: 4  | Text: 五年 十年
Segment #202 [00:03:58,480 --> 00:03:59,200] | Elapsed: 176.11s | Words: 5  | Text: 哪怕十五年
Segment #203 [00:04:00,740 --> 00:04:01,860] | Elapsed: 176.11s | Words: 6  | Text: 风一吹什么种声
